Fetched by the user, not bundled
------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Unitree G1 12-DoF MJCF, its meshes and the pretrained walking policy
        (motion.pt), from unitree_rl_gym
        (https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_rl_gym) @ 276801e,
        BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2016-2023 HangZhou YuShu TECHNOLOGY CO.,LTD.
        ("Unitree Robotics"). `python scripts/fetch_assets.py g1` copies the
        files pinned (sha256) in vector_os_nano/embodiments/g1/robot.yaml into
        ~/.vector/assets/g1_gait/ and writes the upstream LICENSE beside them.
  - Perception model weights, at the revisions pinned in the package
        (perception/weights.py), into the Hugging Face cache, by
        `python scripts/fetch_assets.py --weights` or on first use:
        IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-tiny (Apache-2.0), yonigozlan/EdgeTAM-hf
        (Apache-2.0) and the timm/repvit_m1.dist_in1k backbone config it reads
        (Apache-2.0).

